-- AIA An Phuc Tron Doi Uu Viet (V082021), Chapter 1, Article 1: the definitions.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/aia-an-phuc.txt.
--
-- A definition that only names a party or a document is realised in the nouns module and
-- quoted here so that every one of 1.1 to 1.33 has a place. A definition that fixes a date,
-- an age, an amount or a class of event is a rule, and is written out below.
--
-- DAYS. The document counts in "ngày" (days), "tháng" (months) and "năm" (years) and defines
-- none of them; this encoding reads them as calendar days, calendar months and calendar years
-- (NOTES.md, fork F42). A month is counted with `add months`, which keeps the day of the month
-- and falls back to the month's last day, as 1.8 itself says for a monthiversary.

§ `Article 1 — Definitions`

-- src:231 | Điều 1: Định nghĩa

